Absolutely love the simulation and what you are building within the AI space. We needed a fresh look, especially in ecommerce. This feels like an experience I have been waiting for in the market for a while, and it finally happened! Well done to the team. 10/10.

David Mataciunas

@kotryna\_kurt1 Thank you so much. This is our mission from the first day: the best product with evidence to support its claim will win!

